WEBVTT

00:09:58.956 --> 00:10:01.716
And here's the thing,
anyone at this point who's thinking,

00:10:01.716 --> 00:10:05.716
"Oh, she means tokenistic,
visible diversity."

00:10:05.756 --> 00:10:07.036
No.

00:10:07.596 --> 00:10:10.076
I'm not asking you to whack on photos

00:10:10.076 --> 00:10:14.436
of people that look like me
onto your website and tick a box.

00:10:14.476 --> 00:10:15.676
(Laughter)

00:10:15.716 --> 00:10:17.076
Although that might be nice.

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:20.116
(Laughter)

00:10:20.116 --> 00:10:22.156
No, that's not what I'm talking about.

00:10:22.156 --> 00:10:26.036
Real diversity brings about
diversity of perspective,

00:10:26.076 --> 00:10:28.276
diversity of views
and diversity of thought.

00:10:28.716 --> 00:10:31.356
Ultimately, and of course,
the inevitable flow-on effect